  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fell_Shiv\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Fell_Shiv\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Item:Fell Shiv\">Fell Shiv</a></span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #CCFF99 solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#CCFF99;--bg-color-1-dark:#3D5F1A;--bg-color-2:#EEFFCC;--bg-color-2-dark:#272F17;--header-color:#CCFF99;--header-color-dark:#3D5F1A;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99; width: 15%;\">Proficiency Class\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC; width: 42.5%;\">Simple Weapon Proficiency\n</td>\n<th class=\"bg-color-2\" rowspan=\"19\" style=\"background:#EEFFCC;\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Fell_Shiv_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Fell_Shiv_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"596\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\">Accepts Sentience?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\">No\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\">Damage and Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\">2[1d4] + 4 Pierce, Magic\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\"><a href=\"/page/Threat_range\" title=\"Threat range\">Critical threat range</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\">19-20 / x2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\">Weapon Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Dagger\" title=\"Dagger\">Dagger</a></b> / Piercing weapons\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\">Minimum Level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\">26\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Required Trait\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">None\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\"><a href=\"/page/Use_Magical_Device\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Use Magical Device\">Use Magical Device</a> <a href=\"/page/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">No UMD needed\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Handedness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Attack Mod\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">STR, DEX\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Damage Mod\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">STR, DEX\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Equip</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">300\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Made from\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">Steel</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">Steel</a>:</b> <b>Steel</b> is the common metal used to make weapons and armor.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">36\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0010400200</span>10,400<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;2<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">gp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Gold Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">1.00 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Thrill_of_the_Hunt\" title=\"The Thrill of the Hunt\">The Thrill of the Hunt</a></b>, <a href=\"/page/Devouring_Shadow\" title=\"Devouring Shadow\">Devouring Shadow</a> chest (Epic Hard)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+4 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+4 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +4 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Vorpal#Greater_Vorpal\" title=\"Vorpal\"> Greater Vorpal</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Vorpal#Greater_Vorpal\" title=\"Vorpal\"> Greater Vorpal</a>:</b> Passive: <a href=\"/page/Weapon_dice_multiplier\" title=\"Weapon dice multiplier\">+0.5[W]</a> damage dice.<br />On <a href=\"/page/Vorpal_Strike\" title=\"Vorpal Strike\">Vorpal Hit</a>: If your target has fewer than 2000 Hit Points, they are instantly slain. If your target has above 2000 Hit Points, they take 200 damage.</span></span></li>\n<li>One of the following:\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Dazing\" title=\"Dazing\"> Dazing VI</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Dazing\" title=\"Dazing\"> Dazing VI</a>:</b> On Hit: Your target suffers a -1 Penalty to <a href=\"/page/Will\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will\">Will</a> Saving Throws for 6 seconds. This effect stacks up to 5 times. This effect may only occur on-hit once every three seconds.<br />Passive: The DC of the saving throw to resist your <a href=\"/page/Stunning_Blow\" title=\"Stunning Blow\">Stunning Blow</a> and <a href=\"/page/Stunning_Fist\" title=\"Stunning Fist\">Stunning Fist</a> combat feats is increased by 11.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception VI</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception VI</a>:</b> 5% Chance on Hit: Your target becomes Bluffed for four seconds. (Bluffed enemies can be affected by Sneak Attacks even while targeting you.) On sneak attack: +6 to Attack Rolls, +12 to Damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Doublestrike\" title=\"Doublestrike\"> Doublestrike 6%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Doublestrike\" title=\"Doublestrike\"> Doublestrike 6%</a>:</b> Passive: 6% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Doublestrike. (Doublestrike is a chance to score an additional hit with a melee attack.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Draining\" title=\"Draining\">Draining&#32;VI</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Draining\" title=\"Draining\">Draining&#32;VI</a>:</b> On <a href=\"/page/Vorpal_Strike\" title=\"Vorpal Strike\"> Vorpal Hit</a>: Your target incurs one <a href=\"/page/Negative_Level\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Negative Level\">Negative Level</a>, and you gain +12 Temporary Spell Points. (These Temporary Spell Points last for one minute, or until used to reduce the cost of your next spell.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Feeding\" title=\"Feeding\">Feeding&#32;VI</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Feeding\" title=\"Feeding\">Feeding&#32;VI</a>:</b> On <a href=\"/page/Vorpal_Strike\" title=\"Vorpal Strike\">Vorpal Hit</a>: Your target incurs one <a href=\"/page/Negative_Level\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Negative Level\">Negative Level</a>, and you gain +30 <a href=\"/page/Temporary_hit_point\" title=\"Temporary hit point\">temporary hit points</a>. (These Temporary Hit Points last for one minute, or until used to negate incoming damage.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Ghostbane\" title=\"Ghostbane\">Ghostbane VI</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Ghostbane\" title=\"Ghostbane\">Ghostbane VI</a>:</b> On Hit: 6 to 24 Bane Damage vs <a href=\"/page/Undead\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Undead\">Undead</a>. (Bane damage cannot be resisted.)<br />Passive: Attacks from this weapon bypass the miss chance of <a href=\"/page/Incorporeal\" title=\"Incorporeal\">incorporeal</a> creatures, such as ghosts, shadows, and wraiths.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Heartseeker\" title=\"Heartseeker\">Heartseeker VI</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Heartseeker\" title=\"Heartseeker\">Heartseeker VI</a>:</b> On Critical Hit: 13 to 78 Piercing damage from weapons with a x2 Critical Multiplier, 13 to 104 Piercing damage from weapons with a x3 Critical Multiplier, and 13 to 130 Piercing damage from weapons with a x4 or greater Critical Multiplier.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Humanoid Bane VI</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Humanoid Bane VI</a>:</b> On Hit: 6 to 24 Bane Damage vs <a href=\"/page/Humanoid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Humanoid\">Humanoids</a> and <a href=\"/page/Giant\" title=\"Giant\">Giants</a>. (Bane damage cannot be resisted.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Disruption#Improved_Disruption\" title=\"Disruption\"> Improved Disruption</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Disruption#Improved_Disruption\" title=\"Disruption\"> Improved Disruption</a>:</b> On Hit: 4 to 24 <a href=\"/page/Bane\" title=\"Bane\">Bane</a> damage to <a href=\"/page/Undead\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Undead\">Undead</a>.<br />On <a href=\"/page/Vorpal_Strike\" title=\"Vorpal Strike\">Vorpal Hit</a>: If an undead struck by this weapon has fewer than 1500 Hit Points, it is instantly slain. If the undead has above 1500 Hit Points, it takes 150 damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Smiting#Improved_Smiting\" title=\"Smiting\"> Improved Smiting</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Smiting#Improved_Smiting\" title=\"Smiting\"> Improved Smiting</a>:</b> On Hit: 4 to 24 <a href=\"/page/Bane\" title=\"Bane\">Bane</a> damage to <a href=\"/page/Construct\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Construct\">Constructs</a>.<br />On <a href=\"/page/Vorpal_Strike\" title=\"Vorpal Strike\">Vorpal Hit</a>: If a construct struck by this weapon has fewer than 1500 Hit Points, it is instantly slain. If the construct has above 1500 Hit Points, it takes 150 damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Natural Bane VI</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bane_(enchantment)\" title=\"Bane (enchantment)\">Natural Bane VI</a>:</b> On Hit: 6 to 24 Bane Damage vs <a href=\"/page/Animal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Animal\">Animals</a>, <a href=\"/page/Vermin\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vermin\">Vermin</a>, <a href=\"/page/Magical_Beast\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Magical Beast\">Magical Beasts</a>, <a href=\"/page/Plant\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Plant\">Plants</a> and <a href=\"/page/Fey\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fey\">Fey</a>. (Bane damage cannot be resisted.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Riposte\" title=\"Riposte\">Riposte VI</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Riposte\" title=\"Riposte\">Riposte VI</a>:</b> When Missed by an attack: Deals 6 to 24 damage to your attacker. Passive: +3 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>, +3 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Fortitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude\">Fortitude</a>, <a href=\"/page/Reflex\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex\">Reflex</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Will\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will\">Will</a> <a href=\"/page/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Stumbling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stumbling\"> Stumbling VI</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Stumbling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stumbling\"> Stumbling VI</a>:</b> On Hit: Your target suffers a -1 Penalty to <a href=\"/page/Reflex\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex\">Reflex</a> Saving Throws for 6 seconds. This effect stacks up to 5 times. This effect may only occur on-hit once every three seconds.<br />Passive: The DC of the saving throw to resist your <a href=\"/page/Trip\" title=\"Trip\">Trip</a> combat feats is increased by 11.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sundering\" title=\"Sundering\">Sundering VI</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sundering\" title=\"Sundering\">Sundering VI</a>:</b> On Hit: Your target suffers a -1 Penalty to <a href=\"/page/Fortitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude\">Fortitude</a> Saving Throws for 6 seconds. This effect stacks up to 5 times. This effect may only occur on-hit once every three seconds.<br />Passive: The DC of the saving throw to resist your <a href=\"/page/Sunder\" title=\"Sunder\">Sunder</a> combat feats is increased by 11.</span></span></li>\n<li>Debilitating:\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Weakening\" title=\"Weakening\">Weakening</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Weakening\" title=\"Weakening\">Weakening</a>:</b> This weapon drains the enemies' melee power. -1 Strength on a successful hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enfeebling\" title=\"Enfeebling\">Enfeebling</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enfeebling\" title=\"Enfeebling\">Enfeebling</a>:</b> Critical hits by this weapon deal an extra 1 to 6 points of Strength damage.</span></span></li>\n<li>One of the following:\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Stunning\" title=\"Stunning\"> Stunning +10</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Stunning\" title=\"Stunning\"> Stunning +10</a>:</b> +10 Enhancement bonus to the DC of character's Stunning Blow and Stunning Fist attempts.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Shatter\" title=\"Shatter\">Shatter +10</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Shatter\" title=\"Shatter\">Shatter +10</a></b>: Th